    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoó Mungú aníng ina báy, «Heewí, aariím daanduú tlom'aá Israeliwo. Kibeeto, Axweesante'eé' iiárií qaasaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Wakuuserhúng naa niqís nee inooín ta kaahi, kuungá' aga aalir'ín tleehhité'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, Esekiéli, kuúng aariím ta ó', ‹Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, kuungaá tlom'aá múk Israeli, muu naa yaamaá tawo tleéhh, nee tunda i haratláy bihhe sleémeerowo, nee aga daqaari'iimár xoordaá hatlá' tleehhité', nee tari gár ta kaantin, nee ar ta waaqaqaai tla/ángw xoordu sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, kuungaá tlom'aá múk Israeli, axweesante'eé' iiárií qaasaak, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ. Kuungá' tlóm'i nee gongoáma' nee kutloó ma'aay, nee tlapu, nee xatso, nee gixsadudaá sluhhaay, kuungádá' taa haasaáng wa huúw, nee tunda waaqaá' nee xoordudá' sleémeero naa harweeriye'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala hám daxta aníng taa ló'wa buhhtís, aníng xoordaá hatlá' i sakwasleemuút, kawa ure múk Edomu. Inooín adoodá' yaamuueé' ngiwa kooín tleehhiyé' ngina saqwalaala/iyé', aníng iri waaqaaiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, aariím daanduú múk Israeliwo, tlom'ii'ín nee gongoamaawo nee kutlo ma'aay nee xatsoowo, ki beer, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹An axweés ar sla'aarir'eé' tidá' da/tá koom daanduú yaamuueene, asma yaamuueé' kaa ló'wa /oosliislín nee xoordaá hatlá'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looeemaawo anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Múk xoordaá hatlá' kudaá awa inslaawayhúng, inooíná kilá' kin /oosliislín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala gawaá tlom'aá yaamaá Israeliwo xaai haleemi ngi duuxiyá', nee mamu ngi laqwaaliyá' as muk'eé' oo Israeli, asma inooín deeloorí tseewe ta kii/ ayaaín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aawaak, aníng a bartahúng i dirií', aníng kuungá' nu warqeés, tundu doosl tunduri dahaasín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli un ló'wa tlahhás. Gixsaduuín ki tleehh, nee taanguuín ki male /abees tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu nee makaywo in ló'wa tlahhás. Nee kuungá' tlóm'i, tundu male hoot adoodár aáng wa ale. Muruú hhó' ngu ló'wa tleéhh adoodá' aáng ba/a. Daqaní kuungá' a tsahhá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng múk Israeli un aleesleemuú i haniís oo kuungá' tunduwa yaamií kala/an. Nee kuungá' nay aaliyá', tam na/ii'ín i malé tsu/a'aaká.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ an kah, ‹As muu daanduhunge iwa kaahi, kuungá' a múk /agá' nee xoororhúng aga na/ii faké', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala hám daxta a ki/a'aaká malé ale muu /aymaaro, laqaá na/aá xoororhúng kiwa hayohiindá'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng xoordaá hatlá' i malé pa/aángwí hanisaaká oo kuungá' nuwa /oosliislina'. Nee sleeme xoororhúng i malé dakuuská.› Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, qoomár múk Israeli iwa hoót baraá yaamuuín wa ale, ayaaín nguna slasla/areesiyé' ar tlehhmi'ii'ín kudá' tlakw. Tlehhmi'ii'ín ngiwa ga/aw slasla/aruuwo, i qoná' nee /ameenír baraá deeloorós i dirii'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ina i buúhh asma tseereedá' naa ku'uusiye' baraá yaamuwo nee munguiidá' hatlá' kudá' yaamuuín ngaa slasla/areesiye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina diyaá/ baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlá', ngiri tsiyayaáx baraá yaamaá hatlá'. Inooín ina sakwasleemuút ar har qoomoó tlehhmi'ii'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam qoomaadá' tawa baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlá', umuueé' nguna /oosliisliné', tam muu tari oó' daanduuine, ‹Ga/aawaak, mukwí an kuduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ala inooín kina loohatís baraá yaamuuwose ar /uuru.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ana gurboo/áw as umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó' múk Israeli nguwa slasla/areesiyé' baraá tla/ángw xoorduudá' inooín naa kayé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe múk Israeli kubeer, Aakoó MUNGÚ i kaahi, Tí ni tleehhár wa slaa' a tleehhaaká as kuungá', ala an tlehhiít as ilaiwa/amér umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó', kudá' kuungá' taa slasla/areesé' baraá tla/ángw xoorduudá' ti diya/até'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuueé' kudá' úr kuungá' taa slasla/areesé' baraá tla/ángw xoorduudá' wa alé, un adoorós tidár aáng i ki/ís baraá tla/angw'ine. Qoomaarí an qoomaadá' xoorduká' ngiwa tsaahhiya' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. Aníng kuungá' nu gadiyuús as hhohhooari ngiwa laqaam geeraá xoorduuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nu duúx baraá tla/ángw xoordú wa alé, nee nuri burumbuúr baraá yaamaá dah'iimár wa alé, nuri ki/ís baraá yaamuuhúng awa kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nun ma'áy tsiririxiís, ma'aá hhohho', nee tari hhoohhoaaeerá' baraá slasla/aruhúng kudae, nee dír slasla/aruú slaqsi'iihúng kudaá mungui sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nun muunuú /abén i haniís, nee qeeruú /abén nguri qaás baraahúng i alé. Muunuúdá' gawít baraahunge oo adór tlaa/ano un hingeés, nee nuri muunuú ilaiwa/amér i haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qeeruueé' nguri baraahúng i qaás, nee nuri intsaahhatís daber'eé' kawa eehada' nee kaahir'eé' kari iialooeesá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari hotá' baraá yaamaá baabi'iihúng naa hootiyé'. Kuungá' tari muk'eé', aníng tari Munguúhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nun ba/amís baraá slasla/aruhúng sleémeerowo. Aníng balangwhúng ngu hamareés, tam giyeé ni baloó tleeraaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng mamaá xaai nee balángw qamu i tlahhás, as mutunduwa murekeés ar giyeé tidá' tla/ángw xoorduuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy kuungá' hotaarirhúng tidá' tlakw kari insleerá', nee tlehhmi'iihúng kudá' tlakwe, kuungá' tari kiloohúng ahhitá' asma tlakweemahúng nee muruudá' aníng ni waak taa tlehhé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala xuaak, adoorí a tleehhaaká as kuungá'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. Múk Israeli gimsé', muruuté' nee ta amoqwaqwadiindá' asma tlehhmi'iihúng kudá' tlakw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Baldá' aníng tlakweemaahúng kudá' sleémeero bira hheehhe'eés, gixsaduhúng ngiri ya/aám kiwa male hota', nee sluhhayhúng kuri male /abees tleehharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuudá' aáng na xaanxay tleehhitiye' kin malé doosl, tam múk baraadár waaraáhh mingiwa ár tawa xaanxaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu iri ooi, ‹Yaamuká' aáng adór xaanxaay, hamí daxta a adór asalmooduú Edeni, nee gixsadudá' aáng naa deewaiyé', kudá' tawa lóh niri sluhhuutiyé', hamí daxta ki hoot nee muu, slamí kaa harweér ar koo/ír gawit.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo xoorduudá' naa meetiye' dír inslaawayhunge, ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tar kudá' wa/ameedá' aa hhitiruumit gaa /abees tleehhamooro, nee dahaasiingw nguri dahaás baraá yaamuudaá xaanxaay. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó', nee adoorí an adór ni tleehh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
